NOTE: This repository contains no third-party source code. The AMD ISP4 driver
(GPL-2.0+) is fetched from the Linux kernel tree at install time at the ref
pinned in files/webcam/isp4.provenance and verified against
files/webcam/isp4.sha256. It is never redistributed here.
